<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In How Do Language Models Compose Functions?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Processing Signatures (Correct)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In How Do Language Models Compose Functions?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Processing Signatures (Incorrect)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In How Do Language Models Compose Functions?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Token Identity Patchscope</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In How Do Language Models Compose Functions?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Causality of Intermediate Variables</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In How Do Language Models Compose Functions?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Linearity Correlations</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
  <a id="license-tr" href="https://info.arxiv.org/help/license/index.html#licenses-available">
