</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Processing Signatures (Incorrect)</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Although we see a difference in aggregate processing signatures (<a href="#S4.F3" title="In 4.2 Results ‣ 4 Analyzing Processing Mechanisms ‣ How Do Language Models Compose Functions?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and <a href="#S4.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ 4.2 Results ‣ 4 Analyzing Processing Mechanisms ‣ How Do Language Models Compose Functions?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>), where the signal for the intermediate variables is clearer in the correct cases than the incorrect cases, this does not appear to be generally true (and is more likely due to data imbalances). We can see significant presence of the intermediate variables when considering incorrect examples, de-aggregated by task (<a href="#A5.F8" title="In Appendix E Processing Signatures (Incorrect) ‣ How Do Language Models Compose Functions?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Fig.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F8" class="ltx_figure">
<div id="A5.F8.2" class="ltx_logical-block">
        
<div id="A5.F8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent ltx_align_center">
<div id="A5.F8.p1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:448.8pt;height:411.8pt;vertical-align:-203.4pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1,1) ;">
<p id="A5.F8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F8.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="A5.F8.p1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="A5.F8.p1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A5.F8.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.01685v1/antonym-french_incorrect.svg" id="A5.F8.p1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:137/137;" width="137" height="137"></object></span>
<span id="A5.F8.p1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.01685v1/antonym-german_incorrect.svg" id="A5.F8.p1.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:137/137;" width="137" height="137"></object></span>
<span id="A5.F8.p1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.01685v1/antonym-spanish_incorrect.svg" id="A5.F8.p1.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:137/137;" width="137" height="137"></object></span>
